## Supabase configuration (get from supabase.com > Project Settings > API)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

## Datel Clinic System backend (Express API — keep if using hybrid mode)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:6000/api
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=Datel Clinic System

## HUDI-SOFT central licensing API
NEXT_PUBLIC_HUDI_SOFT_API_URL=https://hudi-soft-com-yiq7.onrender.com/api
